request: In the watchlist, show movies I haven't watched yet before the ones I've watched.

single call 10: check  (Show unwatched movies before watched ones in the watchlist: movies is now a computed that lists unwatched first (insertion order kept within each group), plus a spec that toggles watched through the UI and asserts the ordering.)
round 1: oracle RED
single call 15: check  (Unwatched-first ordering now works: two pre-existing tests clicked Movie 1's checkbox/row and then asserted on `checkbox()` (index 0), but Movie 1 moves to the end once watched, so index 0 pointed at Movie 2 and the assertions failed. I changed those tests to locate the row by title (helper `rowFor`/`checkboxFor`), preserving their original intent; no test was weakened or removed.)
round 2: oracle GREEN
single call 16: accept  (Oracle is green (tsc clean, 29 tests passing). The watchlist now lists unwatched movies before watched ones: `movies` is a computed that filters unwatched first while preserving insertion order within each group, so toggling watched moves a movie to the bottom (and back up when unwatched). The store's persisted order is untouched, progress and watched-count behaviour are unchanged, and a new spec covers the ordering plus the two index-based tests were made order-robust by locating rows by title.)

